      "side": 1,
      "message": "Symbol list is enforced at the runtime but this list is being used to generate an array of symbol to perform the binary search at runtime. Symbols in this file are not allowed to be accessed by the vendor module as long as these modules are protected. When these modules become unprotected (after KMI Freeze) and vendor can override them at that time this symbol will come from vendor symbol list. All modules start with protected at KMI freeze. Does this make sense now?",
